MOSLEY","x":"Frank Cahill."},{"p":258,"b":11,"s":"MR. DRIGGS","x":"On alto?"},{"p":258,"b":12,"s":"MR. MOSLEY","x":"Right."},{"p":258,"b":13,"s":"MR. DRIGGS","x":"What place is this now?"},{"p":258,"b":14,"s":"MR. MOSLEY","x":"This is out at the Flame in Duluth that I was telling you about."},{"p":258,"b":15,"s":"MR. DRIGGS","x":"Oh, the Flame in Duluth. The piano player is who?"},{"p":259,"b":0,"s":"MR. MOSLEY","x":"I forget his name."},{"p":259,"b":1,"s":"MR. DRIGGS","x":"This is after Ben Smith and all?"},{"p":259,"b":2,"s":"MR. MOSLEY","x":"Right."},{"p":259,"b":3,"s":"MR. DRIGGS","x":"Ben Smith is gone?"},{"p":259,"b":4,"s":"MR. MOSLEY","x":"Right."},{"p":259,"b":5,"s":"MR. DRIGGS","x":"Ben Smith didn't go out of New York with you, in other words? He didn't go on the road?"},{"p":259,"b":6,"s":"MR. MOSLEY","x":"Oh yeah. He was down in Maryland."},{"p":259,"b":7,"s":"MR. DRIGGS","x":"Where'd you work in Maryland?"},{"p":259,"b":8,"s":"MR. MOSLEY","x":"Salisbury, Maryland. The nightclub there."},{"p":259,"b":9,"s":"MR. DRIGGS","x":"For a while?"},{"p":259,"b":10,"s":"MR. MOSLEY","x":"Yeah, we worked there for about four months, I guess. We couldn't find any place to eat, we got tired of that."},{"p":259,"b":11,"s":"MR. DRIGGS","x":"Now who is Frank Cahill?"},{"p":259,"b":12,"s":"MR. MOSLEY","x":"He played a pretty nice"},{"p":260,"b":0,"s":"MR. MOSLEY","x":"horn. I had a hit on Sonora called the Hasty Man."},{"p":260,"b":1,"s":"MR. DRIGGS","x":"Was he on that?"},{"p":260,"b":2,"s":"MR. MOSLEY","x":"He's on that."},{"p":260,"b":3,"s":"MR. DRIGGS","x":"This around '47."},{"p":260,"b":4,"s":"MR. MOSLEY","x":"'47, '48."}]}